g>&lt;记录结束&gt;</strong></p> </blockquote> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;显示附录“熊孩子”保护协议</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">隐藏</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <blockquote> <p>因SCP-CN-1426-J群体的特殊性和广泛性，现签定“熊孩子”保护协议。协议自20██-█-██起生效。</p> <p>协议内容如下：<br /> <strong>1.</strong>任何单位和个人不得利用SCP-CN-1426-J进行商业活动。</p> <p><strong>2.</strong>监护者不得长期离开SCP-CN-1426-J使SCP-CN-1426-J处于无人看护的状态。</p> <p><strong>3.</strong>若发生SCP-CN-1426-J个体失踪事件，监护者应立即报告有关部门并派出相应人员进行搜寻。</p> <p><strong>4.</strong>不论以何种理由盗取SCP-CN-1426-J个体的人员将被定位、追踪和扣留。</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purgatory-shuyet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6941139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607827103" alt="Purgatory Shuyet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6941139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/purgatory-shuyet" >Purgatory Shuyet</a></span></p> 
